1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,780
NASA slammed a spacecraft into an asteroid at 14,000 mph.

2
00:00:05,259 --> 00:00:08,699
The target was a tiny moon circling a bigger asteroid.

3
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:11,660
The hit cut its orbit short by 33 minutes.

4
00:00:12,125 --> 00:00:14,980
And it blasted out a tail of rock 6,000 miles long.

5
00:00:15,419 --> 00:00:18,300
Now Europe's Hera probe just arrived to see the crater.

6
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:23,620
But there may be no crater. The whole moon changed shape, like a sandcastle.

7
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:24,699
All because
